{
  "id": "language-disorder",
  "term": "language disorder",
  "definition": "Language disorder, as described here in its developmental form, is a neurodevelopmental condition involving ongoing difficulty learning and processing language. It is associated with slower real-time language processing, weaker prediction during comprehension, and greater reliance on meaning-based cues than on grammatical information.",
